{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/e83fe8ac285a0546465a91261d072f52.webp?t=1766215451\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/4a604af29ca41fccae74f5a1c6535678.poster.avif?t=1766215451\" width=616 height=301 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/4a604af29ca41fccae74f5a1c6535678.webm?t=1766215451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build machines and design efficient production lines to handle everything from resource processing to magical energy flow. Turn raw materials \u2014 and enemy loot \u2014 into a thriving mana-powered factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/8cd64c838ba6904863b6bc2905a415f9.webp?t=1766215451\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/28099676f09de88960d722ff2e1fbf0f.poster.avif?t=1766215451\" width=616 height=301 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/28099676f09de88960d722ff2e1fbf0f.webm?t=1766215451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a vast, open world filled with magical biomes, hidden secrets, and ancient ruins. Discover valuable resources, rare artifacts, and enemies guarding what you need to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/4cba92aa463a46f2807814cdd25402e5.webp?t=1766215451\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/130023a5238192870d4e906a276f62b6.poster.avif?t=1766215451\" width=616 height=301 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/extras/130023a5238192870d4e906a276f62b6.webm?t=1766215451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against hostile creatures lurking in the wilds. Use weapons, spells, and strategy to survive \u2014 and harvest their remains to fuel your factory\u2019s expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915380?t=1766215451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915380?t=1766215451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/6cc310b1dc90651c0af7cb3725b16c6b227aa163/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766215451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915380/6cc310b1dc90651c0af7cb3725b16c6b227aa163/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766215451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps